### ===========================================
### Intersections API Tests
### ===========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### GET traffic lights for intersection - 200 OK
### Public read-only endpoint used by the intersection details page.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/intersections/1/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json

### GET traffic lights for non-existent intersection - 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/intersections/9999/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json

